        <mxCell id="18" value="&lt;b&gt;Legenda&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;POST /requests:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. FastAPI persiste PENDING + publica evento&lt;br&gt;2. Consumer atualiza status (APPROVED / MANUAL_REVIEW)&lt;br&gt;3. Consumer invalida cache Redis&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;GET /requests/{id}:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;cache-aside: Redis hit &#x2192; resposta&lt;br&gt;Redis miss &#x2192; MySQL &#x2192; popula cache" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#666666;fillColor=#f5f5f5;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=8;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;fontSize=11;rounded=1;" vertex="1" parent="1">
